  "fullContentHtml": "\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">Bihar Income, Cast, Residential Certificate Online Apply &amp; Verification 2026 : Short Details</h1>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-01-05T14:09:49+05:30\">January 5, 2026</time></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">2:09 pm</span>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"><a href=\"https://serviceonline.bihar.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>The Right to Public Service (RTPS) Bihar,</strong></a> under the <strong>e-District Mission Mode Project,</strong> is accepting online applications for <strong>various certificates, including Residential Certificate, Caste Certificate, Income Certificate, Character Certificate, NCL Certificate, and EWS Certificate.</strong> All eligible and interested male and female applicants can apply online through the official <strong>RTPS Bihar portal at serviceonline.bihar.gov.in</strong> for <strong>Nivas Praman Patra, Jati Praman Patra, Aay Praman Patra, Charitra Praman Patra, as well as NCL and EWS certificates.</strong></span></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Telegram </a></div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">Bihar Income, Cast, Residential Certificate Online Apply &amp; Verification 2026</h2>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">Bihar Income, Cast, Residential Certificate Online Apply &amp; Verification 2026</h3>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/bihar-income-cast-residential-certificate-online-apply-verification-2026/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Application Start : </strong>Already Start</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Last Date for Apply Online : </strong>Not Available</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">There is no application fee required for registration, checking, or verification of Caste, Income, and Domicile Certificates. Simply visit the provided link and enter your Praman Patra Number to check the status.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">NA</h5>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Bihar Income, Cast, Residential Certificate Online Registration, Apply &amp; Verification 2026</strong></span></p>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">NA</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\">\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\">Bihar Income, Cast, Residential Certificate Online Apply &amp; Verification 2026</h6>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 280px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 28px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 28px;\" colspan=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080;\"><strong>&nbsp;RTPS Bihar Key Highlights&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 28px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 28px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Service Name</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 28px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Right to Public Service, Bihar</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 28px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 28px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Project Name</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 28px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">e-District is a Mission Mode Project</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 28px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 28px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Portal Name</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 28px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">RTPS Bihar</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 84px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 84px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">RTPS Services List</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 84px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Residential Certificate, Caste Certificate, Income Certificate, Character Certificate, NCL and EWS Certificate etc.</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 28px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 28px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Link Status</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 28px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"><strong class=\"green\">Working</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 28px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 28px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">RTPS Bihar Website Link</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 28px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">serviceonline.bihar.gov.in</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 28px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 28px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Helpline Email</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 28px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"><a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\" class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"1c6f796e6a757f79737270757279327e75747d6e5c7b736a327572\">[email&nbsp;protected]</a></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080;\"><strong>&nbsp;Purpose of RTPS Bihar Online Application&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"53\" data-end=\"280\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">The process of obtaining essential certificates like income, caste, and residency from government offices has traditionally been long and time-consuming. To simplify this, the state government has introduced an online platform.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"528\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">This new facility allows residents to conveniently apply for these certificates from their homes, requiring only an internet connection. By eliminating the need to visit offices and endure long waits, it saves both time and effort for the public.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080;\"><strong> &nbsp;RTPS Bihar Important Information&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">The caste of an individual is determined based on the caste of their father, not that of their husband.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">The validity of the caste certificate is permanent.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">The validity of a permanent residence certificate is always valid, whereas the validity of a temporary residence certificate is for one year from the date of issue.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">The validity of an income certificate is for one year from the date of issue.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">After verification, the original certificates will be returned to the candidates.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates can submit an undertaking in the prescribed format regarding not being in the creamy layer, based on which a new certificate without the creamy layer can be issued, using the old certificate without the creamy layer.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">There is no need to repeatedly obtain a certificate without the creamy layer. For state services, an application can be submitted with an old certificate along with an undertaking.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080;\"><strong>&nbsp;RTPS Bihar Apply Online Method&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"57\" data-end=\"102\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Visit the official website <strong>serviceonline.bihar.gov.in.</strong></span></li>\n<li data-start=\"106\" data-end=\"202\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">If the applicant is a <strong>new user</strong>, <strong>create a Login ID and Password</strong> by selecting “<strong>Register Yourself</strong>.”</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"206\" data-end=\"302\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">From the left menu on the website, click on the relevant department’s linked service and log in.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"306\" data-end=\"354\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Click on “<strong>Apply for Service</strong>” from the left menu.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"496\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Fill out the application form carefully, upload your photo via Webcam or File Browser, make necessary corrections, and click Save Draft.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"744\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>(a)</strong> If the service requires an Aadhaar number, an OTP will be sent to the mobile number registered with the applicant’s Aadhaar for verification, or <strong>(b)</strong> upload one of the 12 identification documents approved by the Election Commission of India.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"838\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">If required for the specific service, attach the necessary annexures by clicking Attach.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"927\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Carefully read the application form and annexure list and make necessary corrections.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"992\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Submit the application and download/print the acknowledgment.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1151\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">After the certificate is issued, it will be available in the applicant’s inbox. The applicant can log in to the website to download/print the certificate.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080;\"><strong>&nbsp;How To Download RTPS Bihar Certificate&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Visit the official <strong>RTPS Bihar</strong> website at serviceonline.bihar.gov.in.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">On the homepage, under the “<strong>Citizen Section</strong>” on the right-hand side, click the link titled “<strong>Download Certificate</strong>.”</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">You will be directed to the <strong>RTPS Download Certificate</strong> page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">From the drop-down menu, choose “<strong>RTPS/Others</strong>” under Services.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Enter your Application Ref. Number <strong>(e.g., BICCO/2021/0000)</strong> and Applicant Name <strong>(in English)</strong>.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Finally, click on the “<strong>Download Certificate</strong>” button to retrieve your certificate from RTPS server 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, and so on.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Note</strong>: Ensure you download your certificate only 24 hours after the execution of your application.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080;\"><strong>&nbsp;RTPS Bihar Application Status&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Visit the official <strong>RTPS Bihar</strong> website at <strong>serviceonline.bihar.gov.in</strong>.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">On the homepage, under the “<strong>Citizen Section</strong>” on the right-hand side, click the link labeled “<strong>Track Application Status</strong>.”</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">You will be directed to the <strong>Track Application Status</strong> page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Choose how you want to track your application: either by <strong>Application Reference Number</strong> or <strong>OTP/Application Details</strong>.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">If selecting <strong>Application Reference Number</strong>, enter it accurately in the provided field and choose to track via the <strong>Application Submission Date</strong> or <strong>Application Delivery Date</strong>.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Then, type the <strong>Word Verification Code</strong> shown on the page correctly to proceed.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Finally, click the “<strong>Submit</strong>” button to view the status of your application across RTPS servers 1, 2, 3, and so on.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #800000;\"><strong>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow Now</a></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #800000;\"><strong>Join Our Telegram Channel</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\